'''Mystica''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 3.8 Update|Version 3.8]] and can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event/Gacha Drop|Merc Storia Collaboration Gacha]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 11.8 Update|Version 11.8]] gains more damage, the Slow ability and can target Aku enemies. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 13.7 Update|Version 13.7]].

