==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Mystica CC''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Savior Mystica CC''' at level 30 using [[Catfruit]] and XP.

==Strategy/Usage==
This unit's specialty is her 690 range that qualifies her as a Super-Backliner that can outrange many enemies. Her main usage is for mid-game where you need a unit that can outrange enemies such as [[THE SLOTH]], [[Master A.]], [[Camelle]], etc. Although her range is great, her generalist usage is very much limited to early-game and mid-game. Her attack rate is ridiculously long (13 seconds) and her DPS is the lowest among massive range units such as [[The Grateful Crane (Uber Rare Cat)|Cosmo]] and [[Radiant Aphrodite (Uber Rare Cat)|Aphrodite]], even against Dark enemies. She also cannot outrange [[Tackey]] nor [[Director Kurosawah]] which greatly limits her usage against stages with those enemies.

Overall, she is a great unit to have if you don't have other super backliners such as [[Madoka Kaname (Uber Rare Cat)|Madoka Kaname]] or [[Radiant Aphrodite (Uber Rare Cat)|Aphrodite]]. Otherwise, she is a very lackluster unit in terms of DPS that will probably not be worth investing in.

==='''True Form'''===
While Mystica gains a few improvements, it's not enough to save her from being a poor backliner. She does get a damage boost, but 2k DPS is still paltry compared to other units such as [[Red Riding Mina (Special Cat)|Red Riding Mina]] and [[Radiant Aphrodite (Uber Rare Cat)|Aphrodite]]. Mystica however has 2 abilities: Slow and Strong against Dark and Aku. Unfortunately, these still aren't enough due to several flaws. The Strong ability gives her a decent damage boost, but compared to previously mentioned units this still only makes her average, although with more base range. If you have [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]], Mystica's Slow against Dark becomes redundant and not useful, and a bad uptime along with the aggresive nature of Dark enemies makes Mystica impractical in most scenarios. Slow versus Aku seems useful, but Mystica has no Shield Breaker and long attack frequency, making it difficult to pull off. If the player lacks any other anti-Aku Ubers she can be usable in the right circumstances, but she should be left on the bench once one is obtained.

==='''Talents'''===
Right away, '''cost down''' is not worth your NP. Mystica is still expensive to deploy, and the cost reduction you get for that much NP is not of practical value whatsoever. Next are the '''attack and HP buffs.''' Mystica already has some underwhelming stats, especially for her cost, so maxing these talents would cost '''350 NP.''' For such a minimal buff, it is not worth it. Her only somewhat considerable talents are her '''survive''' and '''surge immune'''. Surge immune is always good for an anti-aku as death surges are common from that trait,
and survive, whilst costing a hefty '''235 NP''' to guarantee it happening, can be useful if the enemies break through, as her minimal health doesn't allow her to reposition much, especially against high-damaging
melee akus and Darks like [[Fallen Bear]], [[Aku Gory]], [[Shadow Boxer K]], or [[Director Kurosawah]],  though that is probably as much use you'd get out of this talent.

Overall, Mystica's talents try to make her viable, yet they're a '''''waste of NP''''' and don't save this unit from being outclassed by other, non-collab ubers.

